DESCRIPTION:Sommore  reigns as the undisputed “Queen of Comedy.” This 
 trendsetting\, highly-acclaimed veteran entertainer is widely considered on
 e of America’s top funny women. With a winning combination of class and s
 ass\, Sommore offers audiences a hilarious\, yet piercing look at today's i
 ssues from a woman’s perspective. She is frank and fearless in her routin
 es\, tackling topics that range from the mundane to the controversial with 
 wit\, intelligence and style.\n\nPraised by critics\, respected by her peer
 s\, and adored by a diverse fan base\, she performs her stand-up act to sol
 d-out audiences across the country\, and she is among the top-grossing stan
 d-up comediennes in the United States and abroad. Oprah Winfrey proclaimed 
 her “a force to be reckoned with in the new millennium.”\n\nBorn in Tre
 nton\, New Jersey\, Sommore has had a meteoric rise to the top of her field
  and has been a trailblazer for women in the comedy business since her begi
 nning in 1995. The comedian\, actress\, writer\, executive producer\, entre
 preneur\, and television host has created an undisputed name for herself as
  the “Queen of Comedy.”\n\nSommore is incredibly talented\, hilarious a
 nd has made a mark in every genre of entertainment. The self-proclaimed "Ch
 andelier" can be seen in films such as “Friday after Next"\, "Soul Plane"
 \, "Something New" and television series including the Academy Award-winnin
 g series “The Parkers” and "The Hughleys”.\n\nShe has been a featured
  guest on “The Oprah Winfrey Show\,” “The Tonight Show with Jay Leno\
 ,” “The View” and “Politically Incorrect with Bill Maher.” She wa
 s also interviewed on CNN Headline News about her phenomenal artistic and f
 inancial success as a comedienne\, and was profiled in Comedy Central’s 
 “Special Women in Comedy” program.\n\nSommore has wrote\, self produced
 \, and performed in her own one woman Comedy Specials\, “The Queen Stands
  Alone" (2008/Comedy Central)\, "Chandelier Status" (2013/Showtime)\, “Th
 e Reign Continues" (2015/Showtime)\, "A Queen with No Spades"…\nMore info
 : https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-sommore-20885/
